From b304c831520f17a9e2d291580ea5ebf1dc19952d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1aeo <github@1aeo.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:18:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/11] relay_metrics: Add directory and HSDir request and
 topology counters

Export server directory and onion service directory request and topology
counters on the MetricsPort (hsdir_request_total, hsdir_req_reused,
hsdir_circ_reused, hsdir_single_hop, hsdir_unknown_prev_hop,
dir_non_hs_request, and dir_req_unparsed), log hsdir_circ_reused and
hsdir_unknown_prev_hop in the DoS heartbeat, and refactor
fill_dos_values() into a table-driven loop.
